=Extract structured information from this CV text. Be thorough and accurate. Use null for anything not found.

CV TEXT: {{ $('Extract from File').item.json.text }}

Respond in this exact JSON format:
{
  "name": "<full name>",
  "email": "<email or null>",
  "phone": "<phone or null>",
  "summary": "<brief professional summary>",
  "education": [
    { "institution": "<name>", "degree": "<degree title>", "field": "<field or null>", "year": "<graduation year or null>" }
  ],
  "experience": [
    { "company": "<company>", "role": "<job title>", "duration": "<e.g. '2 years' or 'Jan 2020 - Dec 2022'>", "description": "<brief description>" }
  ],
  "skills": ["<skill1>", "<skill2>"],
  "certifications": ["<cert1>", "<cert2>"]
}

